## Change

- `MessageExt` routes wait-store, buyer ID, delay-level, delay-seconds,
  delay-milliseconds and delivery-milliseconds getters through the
  caller-defined subtype's virtual `getProperty` hook.
- Setter dispatch hooks cover wait-store, buyer ID, instance ID, delay level,
  delay seconds, delay milliseconds and delivery milliseconds.
- The invoked Java 5.5.1 direct-consume fixture compares custom getter values
  and all seven setter calls against Rust.

