## Notes

An initial attempt to run the default and all-feature workspace suites in
parallel collided on the consumer tests' exclusive offset-store fixture and
reported `OffsetStore(AlreadyOpen)`. Both suites passed when rerun serially.
No push, remote CI, Broker or Docker run was performed. Pre-existing Phase 19
working-tree paths were left untouched and unstaged.

## Current status

This refresh closes current-revision server-free P18-V02 gates on `c6048c18`.
It covers this inherited-property subtype slice only. Broad P18-V01
API/settings/input/error/control-flow/reverse-export reconciliation, mutable
custom `getProperties()` map identity, and current-revision GitHub Ubuntu and
native Windows P18-V04 runtime evidence remain open. Phase 19 Broker/Docker
validation is separate.
